.Dd August 13, 2026
.Dt VIRTIO_BALLOON 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm virtio_balloon
.Nd VirtIO Memory Balloon driver
.Sh SYNOPSIS
To compile this driver into the kernel,
place the following lines in your
kernel configuration file:
.Bd -ragged -offset indent
.Cd "device virtio_balloon"
.Ed
.Pp
Alternatively, to load the driver as a
module at boot time, place the following line in
.Xr loader.conf 5 :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
virtio_balloon_load="YES"
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
device driver provides support for VirtIO memory balloon devices.
.Pp
The memory balloon allows the guest to, at the request of the
hypervisor, return memory allocated to the hypervisor so it can
be made available to other guests.
The hypervisor can later signal the balloon to return the memory.
.Pp
When the device negotiates the page-poison feature, pages returned to the
guest allocator on deflation are first initialized to the device-supplied
poison value, and the driver reports the poison value it uses to the device.
When the device negotiates the free-page-hint feature, the driver answers a
host-initiated reporting round by allocating a bounded sample of currently
free pages, reporting their physical ranges to the device, and immediately
returning them to the allocator; it reports a bounded sample rather than every
free page.
The continuous free-page reporting feature is deliberately not negotiated.
.Sh SYSCTL VARIABLES
The following read-only variables are available as
.Xr sysctl 8
variables, per attached device.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Va dev.vtballoon. Ns Ar X Ns Va .desired
The balloon size requested by the hypervisor, in 4096-byte units.
.It Va dev.vtballoon. Ns Ar X Ns Va .current
The current balloon size, in 4096-byte units.
.It Va dev.vtballoon. Ns Ar X Ns Va .poisoned
The number of pages initialized to the poison value after acknowledged
deflation, when the page-poison feature is negotiated.
.It Va dev.vtballoon. Ns Ar X Ns Va .free_page_hint_reported
The number of free pages reported in the last free-page-hint round, when the
free-page-hint feature is negotiated.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr virtio 4
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
